%N A057334 In A000120, replace each entry k with the k-th prime and replace 0 with 1.
%H A057334 Amiram Eldar, <a href="/A057334/b057334.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%H A057334 Michael Gilleland, <a href="/selfsimilar.html">Some Self-Similar Integer Sequences</a>.
%F A057334 a(n) = A000040(A000120(n)) for n>0.
%F A057334 a(n) = A008578(1 + A000120(n)). - _Alois P. Heinz_, Nov 03 2024
%t A057334 a[n_] := Prime[DigitSum[n, 2]]; a[0] = 1; Array[a, 84, 0] (* _Amiram Eldar_, Oct 17 2026 *)
%o A057334 (PARI) a(n) = if (n==0, 1, prime(hammingweight(n))); \\ _Michel Marcus_, Feb 08 2014
